          "items": [
            "Wet Sand - Watercolor 6 Bed/6.5 Bath, Sleeps 15<br>Overview:<br>- 1 mile to beach and Beach Club (private access)<br>- 6 bedrooms, 6.5 baths<br>- 2,858 sq ft<br>- Private pool <br>- Access to WaterColor community pools and beach club - 12 wrist band limit<br>- Limited onsite parking, minimal community parking with pass<br>- No garage access<br>- Gas grill<br>- Wi-Fi<br>- No Pets Please<br>- No parties or events<br><br>Note!!! 12 wristbands Max with this home. Children 4 and under do not need bands. No exceptions. This number is assigned by Watercolor HOA.<br><br>Overnight:<br>- King in 1st floor primary bedroom; bath; TV<br>- King in 2nd floor guest room; bath; TV<br>- King in 2nd floor guest room; bath; TV<br>- King in 2nd floor guest room; shared hall bath; TV<br>- 2 bunk sets (4 twin beds) in 2nd floor guest room; shared hall bath; TV<br>- Twin in 2nd floor den<br>- Carriage house - 1 Queen, 1 full bath<br><br>Watercolor assigned 12 wristbands<br><br><br>1 golf cart included 4 seats<br><br>Check-in is 4:00 PM CST. Checkout is 10:00 AM CST.<br><br>A charming house, Wet Sand rests in the Camp WaterColor district, just a few blocks from the beach. The community pools and beach club are gorgeous, and a favorite of kids and adults.<br><br>Out back, a private pool is also impressive. The entire area is ideal for entertaining, especially at night: Check out the photos! The wonderful screened-in porch has comfortable seating and also a dining table.<br><br>Inside, the first-floor open interior is full of color and charm. Expertly decorated, the spacious coastal home provides lots of room to unwind.<br><br>The kitchen is delightful, with an island that seats five. Past the dining table for eight is the primary bedroom, king, that opens to a porch.<br><br>Upstairs are four more rooms, all open to screened porches. A den sleeps an extra person. Two guest rooms, king, have adjoining baths. The bunk room, twin room and den share the hall bath, with tub.<br><br>Welcome! Our dedicated team at Grayton Coast Rentals, a local company, is committed to ensuring your stay is nothing short of exceptional. We strive for perfection and are just a stone's throw away should you require any assistance. Reach out to us anytime, seven days a week, with the added peace of a 24/7 emergency line.<br><br>Overview:<br>- 1 mile to beach and Beach Club (private access)<br>- 6 bedrooms, 6.5 baths, Sleeps 15<br>- 2,858 sq ft<br>- Private pool<br>- Access to WaterColor community pools and beach club - 12 wrist band limit<br>- Limited onsite parking, minimal community parking with pass<br>- No garage access<br>- Gas grill<br>- Wi-Fi",
